0538bb48b7318cc115e2fdc495035a23abf90dd151f406b4dbc88f1d0d31623a {"key": "0538bb48b7318cc115e2fdc495035a23abf90dd151f406b4dbc88f1d0d31623a", "original": {"closure_evidence": [], "counterexample": "两个引用目标中，第一项 Added 已提交 F 和 Applied，第二项尚未执行即退出。重开必须接受第一项的真实归属，同时禁止把第二项当作已写入；沿用完整写集相等规则会拒绝这个合法中间态，放宽为任意子集又会丢失精确阶段约束。另一个反例是 Added 提交后被替换为字节相同、FileId 不同的外来文件：其 inputVersion 是不存在，不能继承输出身份；若 receipt 只包含现列出的哈希/长度，重开无法兑现身份吻合后才删除。方案所写“Stage 允许表必须显式枚举”尚不是该表。", "id": "PLAN-VERSION-CHAIN-1", "obligation": "plan", "paths": ["_workflow/r56-reference-activation-wiring-2026-09-29/native-recovery-20261001/PLAN-v1.md:29", "_workflow/r56-reference-activation-wiring-2026-09-29/native-recovery-20261001/PLAN-v1.md:46", "_workflow/r56-reference-activation-wiring-2026-09-29/native-recovery-20261001/PLAN-v1.md:61", "MultiplayerHoeingAssistant/Services/TaskCenter/MigrationSwitchTransaction.cs:852", "MultiplayerHoeingAssistant/Services/TaskCenter/MigrationSwitchTransaction.cs:1404", "MultiplayerHoeingAssistant/Services/TaskCenter/MigrationSwitchTransaction.cs:1564"], "repair_steps": ["在同一方案中固定 schema2 全字段及摘要覆盖：事务/根身份、不可变登记、baseline 完整版本、operation kind/sequence/predecessor、Prepared 输入与确定性输出、Applied 完整 outputVersion；Added 的输出 FileId 必须来自实际创建句柄并与数据原子落盘。删除使用绑定输入身份的不存在输出及持久墓碑。", "给出全部阶段与每种操作的允许表，明确 Prepared、Applied、部分前缀、B/F/A/R/不存在/X、激活记录、确认集合、失败来源、提交标记的关系。未列组合默认拒绝；Blocked 根据保留的操作来源恢复，不能成为宽泛授权阶段。", "明确引用部分完成时确认集合恰等于有效 Applied 引用操作集合；阶段完成时才要求与全部登记相等。激活/撤销/恢复分别绑定对应已应用前驱，预测不得成为确认事实。", "规定恢复已 Applied 但当前 X 时仍阻断；精确 B 只允许已恢复的只读跳过，不能借其更新 R 或制造新的 Applied。", "明确 Prepared/blob 的持久化交易边界、Applied/data/manifest 的共同交易边界，以及 commit 未知后重新加载收据的流程。同步修订 plan.json 中仍描述旧检查加预测路线的执行段，保留旧文件作为历史而非另一份有效施工指令。"], "root_cause": "统一版本协议的方向已补齐，但尚未形成完整可执行的持久化模式和允许表。PLAN-v1 仅要求未来显式枚举阶段；journal 字段列出 inputVersion/outputHash/outputLength/receipt，却未规定 Applied 收据中的完整输出文件身份、删除墓碑、部分成功集合与阶段关系。当前原校验要求写集与全部登记集合相等，不能直接承载逐项成功后的部分写集。", "severity": "must", "status": "open", "tests": ["PartialAddedWriteThenCancellation_ReopenConverges：第一项真实 Applied、第二项无 Applied，新实例合法加载并恢复。", "AppliedAddedReplacedBySameBytesDifferentFileId_IsPreserved：重开后零误删，不认领外来身份。", "JournalStageVersionMatrix_RejectsEveryUnlistedCombination：全阶段、操作种类与版本组合逐格枚举，包含非法 R 出现在 SnapshotReady/ReferenceUpdating/Activated/Committed。", "PreparedOutputWithoutApplied_IsNeverClaimed：即使输出字节相同仍不得认领。", "ReentryAfterBaselineActivationTargetRestored_Converges：显式 B 不等于 R、真实故障站点、新实例与终态重载。", "分别突变输出身份校验、部分集合关系、Prepared/Applied 判别和 R 阶段限制；要求行为断言失败及完整 P/F/P。"]}, "source": "_workflow/r56-reference-activation-wiring-2026-09-29/native-recovery-20261001/native/requests/ad38c19cd8c347cfa461de14e7961fed/report.json"}
0647d07b0afcaf9b0fa9f5bc6828d63af6222b54599375acd39cc6dad4a8f4b7 {"key": "0647d07b0afcaf9b0fa9f5bc6828d63af6222b54599375acd39cc6dad4a8f4b7", "original": {"closure_evidence": [], "counterexample": "records为46条，矩阵57行；summary标题28，findings写45/42/23，checkpoint写45/39且仍安排round4。M31仍指向反复扰动旧测试；REF-F25注入时序、REF-F26旧恢复用例、M50描述、REF-C4状态和M4原因码击杀均不能支持所称覆盖。", "id": "R5-IMPORTANT-7", "obligation": "implementation", "paths": ["_workflow/r56-reference-activation-wiring-2026-09-29/findings.md", "_workflow/r56-reference-activation-wiring-2026-09-29/owner-checkpoint.md", "_workflow/r56-reference-activation-wiring-2026-09-29/risk-matrix.json", "_workflow/r56-reference-activation-wiring-2026-09-29/mutations/records.json", "_workflow/r56-reference-activation-wiring-2026-09-29/mutations/summary.md", "_workflow/r56-reference-activation-wiring-2026-09-29/manifest.json", "Test/MultiplayerHoeingAssistant.UnitTest/ServiceTests/TaskCenter/R56ReferenceActivationWiringTests.cs"], "repair_steps": "保留round1 IMPORTANT-9、round2 IMPORTANT-8、round3 IMPORTANT-7、round4 IMPORTANT-7和round5 IMPORTANT-7的全部子问题与原级。逐记录核对目标TestId、单点patch、实际断言和源码版本；M31改绑一次性反例并重跑，M50只声明守卫赋值被删除，REF-F25/F26按实际站点修正，REF-C4记适用但未验证。M4等仅原因码变化的击杀不得用来证明危险行为被阻止。旧数字保留为有日期历史，当前统计机器生成。重新取得当前版本认证三段执行，不能复用旧SHA记录。", "root_cause": "测试、突变、矩阵、发现与检查点没有统一到同一版本和真实执行路径；部分所谓击杀仅检测诊断变化。", "severity": "important", "status": "open", "tests": "计数/映射一致性检查；双目标真实部分取消及PartialWriteReportsActualWritesNotRequestedCount；每个关键断言有baseline/mutant/restored认证执行及实际失败；runner互斥、开工前哨和收工逐字节恢复检查；源码与产物版本一致。"}, "source": "_workflow/r56-reference-activation-wiring-2026-09-29/review-process/requests/001/report.json"}
06b0ba77619e6b372efa5f9d6fb92ece485d228b4188ce3d00408c1813e9975a {"key": "06b0ba77619e6b372efa5f9d6fb92ece485d228b4188ce3d00408c1813e9975a", "original": {"closure_evidence": [], "counterexample": "plan.json写审查manifest v2，但运行事务IsManifestIntegrityValidCore只接受schemaVersion=1。新增RevertedHash后，旧ActivationRecord摘要尾部从AfterHash变为AfterHash:<null>，旧合法记录在升级后LoadValidated返回null。", "id": "PLAN-COMPATIBILITY-1", "obligation": "plan", "paths": ["_workflow/r56-reference-activation-wiring-2026-09-29/plan.json", "MultiplayerHoeingAssistant/Services/TaskCenter/MigrationSwitchTransaction.cs", "__review__/git.json"], "repair_steps": "区分workflow设施manifest v2与运行迁移manifest schemaVersion=1。明确旧运行证据的验证、受锁升级和恢复政策，列出旧Committed、Activated、RollingBack、Blocked和RolledBack记录的行为。禁止只用新算法重算旧摘要；先按原版本完整校验，再按明确版本写新记录。若旧版本有无法安全续做状态，具体登记阻断和恢复方法。", "root_cause": "兼容条款只有审查意向，没有针对实际摘要格式变化的迁移方法和验收条件。", "severity": "important", "status": "open", "tests": "由变更前实现生成带真实ActivationRecord的manifest字节，升级后加载、恢复和授权测试；篡改旧摘要必须拒绝；兼容升级中断后新实例重开；无端口旧夹具回归。"}, "source": "_workflow/r56-reference-activation-wiring-2026-09-29/review-process/requests/001/report.json"}
09624e3da1a73206c08aa110478c8d1890774fec8d9f5d07a00dbf32a17d423a {"key": "09624e3da1a73206c08aa110478c8d1890774fec8d9f5d07a00dbf32a17d423a", "original": {"closure_evidence": [], "counterexample": "RecordChanges 的 MoveNext 同步重入修改登记，或使用 SuppressFlow worker 并等待，可造成旧局部状态覆盖或 monitor 等待死锁。", "id": "R5-IMPORTANT-3", "obligation": "implementation", "paths": ["MultiplayerHoeingAssistant/Services/TaskCenter/MigrationSwitchTransaction.cs:549", "MultiplayerHoeingAssistant/Services/TaskCenter/MigrationSwitchTransaction.cs:666", "MultiplayerHoeingAssistant/Services/TaskCenter/MigrationSwitchTransaction.cs:2992"], "repair_steps": ["准入后在 InvokeExternal guard 内完整冻结输入，复制 ChangeRecord 与 target 字段；后续消费者只使用本地副本。", "先冻结，再取得可修改局部 manifest，并重新核对原已拥有 main；callback 的直接写入不能被合法化。", "保留锁前 volatile callback 拒绝及普通并发串行；输入普通异常在数据前转结构化 Fail。", "Dispose 仅请求终结，root/artifact/window 由最外层 EndOperation 释放。"], "root_cause": "外部集合的 GetEnumerator、MoveNext、Current、Dispose、可选 Count/indexer 和可变记录消费尚未全部纳入 callback guard 与不可变输入冻结。", "severity": "important", "status": "open", "tests": ["V18-P12/P13/P14/P15/P16/P17：全部实际消费站、SuppressFlow/UnsafeQueue、可变对象、异常、Dispose、foreign main。", "V18-M12/M13/M14/M15/M16/M17：具名重入、完成时序、输入保全及真实 lease 断言失败；禁止 host timeout 充作击杀。"]}, "source": "_workflow/r56-reference-activation-wiring-2026-09-29/native-recovery-20261001/native-compatibility-v9/requests/659a5d212ef5437790c165f27949a28c/report.json"}
09a5702221ac468f49c2fc9fb4ddfd51c162076120a774f743857cf975f178a8 {"key": "09a5702221ac468f49c2fc9fb4ddfd51c162076120a774f743857cf975f178a8", "original": {"closure_evidence": [], "counterexample": "按任一材料独立复算都会得到不同mutation数、矩阵行数、轮次或故障注入窗口，无法确认哪些测试在哪个状态、哪个独立突变被杀。", "id": "R5-IMPORTANT-7", "obligation": "implementation", "paths": ["_workflow/r56-reference-activation-wiring-2026-09-29/findings.md", "_workflow/r56-reference-activation-wiring-2026-09-29/owner-checkpoint.md", "_workflow/r56-reference-activation-wiring-2026-09-29/risk-matrix.json", "_workflow/r56-reference-activation-wiring-2026-09-29/mutations/records.json", "_workflow/r56-reference-activation-wiring-2026-09-29/mutations/summary.md", "Test/MultiplayerHoeingAssistant.UnitTest/ServiceTests/TaskCenter/R56ReferenceActivationWiringTests.cs"], "repair_steps": ["逐项复算records实际条数、矩阵实际行/类别数及每个mutation target TestId和patch。", "更新summary/checkpoint/findings/matrix/R5.3本批记录：保留旧值作为有日期历史、标清被替代原因和当前核对值。", "按真实注入顺序校正REF-F25；修正旧恢复测试名/说明或补真实fault+reopen；确保M31 one-shot；将M50准确描述为只移除guard assignment。", "生成可复核计数/映射报告。没有有效具名反向突变证据的矩阵行保留未验证，不得标covered。"], "root_cause": "第六轮原文：发现/测试/突变台账未统一到同一代码版本，旧计数、状态、场景标签和mutant补丁描述矛盾。具体：summary标题28而实际46；checkpoint写45/39行且停在round3/下一轮round4；findings写45/42/23；矩阵57=S18+C9+F30；REF-F25把撤销前抛错写成撤销后；旧恢复测试没有中断/重开；M31 OnStatusRead反复扰动而非one-shot；M50实际只删守卫赋值却被描述为同时删异常收敛。", "severity": "important", "status": "open", "tests": ["机器计数与映射一致性断言", "M31 one-shot具名测试", "M50 patch-vs-description逐项核对", "每个关键断言对应testId、单点patch、baseline/mutant/restored TRX与restored source SHA。"]}, "source": "_workflow/r56-reference-activation-wiring-2026-09-29/review-process/registration.json"}
0b891a96d9679f99f823f8ff46a52d7bfb00290fa8098b08d7143b714ccf233d {"key": "0b891a96d9679f99f823f8ff46a52d7bfb00290fa8098b08d7143b714ccf233d", "original": {"closure_evidence": [], "counterexample": "原round1建议指出MigrationRehearsal使用无端口Mark*却报告真实激活。当前注释和步骤名已静态修正；尚无可核验运行报告。", "id": "R1-SUGGESTION-10", "obligation": "implementation", "paths": ["_workflow/r56-reference-activation-wiring-2026-09-29/consultation/review-round1-report.raw.md", "MultiplayerHoeingAssistant/Services/TaskCenter/MigrationRehearsal.cs", "Test/MultiplayerHoeingAssistant.UnitTest/ServiceTests/TaskCenter/R58MigrationRehearsalTests.cs"], "repair_steps": "保留阶段标记演练的准确文案；当前版本执行后核对报告没有把Mark*步骤表示为真实引用/激活生产验收。", "root_cause": "演练报告曾超出实际入口能力。", "severity": "suggestion", "status": "open", "tests": "R58演练报告步骤和最终manifest核对；不以UI文本守卫替代实际报告来源。"}, "source": "_workflow/r56-reference-activation-wiring-2026-09-29/review-process/requests/001/report.json"}
0bc2bb7da38f8d9ce8090b8f2b0a23769714a54aa2daa3c410c6f7bb87fbf527 {"key": "0bc2bb7da38f8d9ce8090b8f2b0a23769714a54aa2daa3c410c6f7bb87fbf527", "original": {"closure_evidence": [], "counterexample": ["真实 prepared 事务达到 SnapshotReady 后 Dispose，以 effectService:null 重开并取得 artifact 锁。RecordChanges 可以 LoadValidated 现代 manifest，并经2597–2611行普通 IO 发布，而没有现代 RootAuthority 和完整 main 输入 CAS。", "现代有 journal 历史由无 prepared 能力实例调用 Rollback/Recover，main 的 RollingBack 发布走普通 IO，旧 CompleteRollback 又单独 SetStage journal；main/journal 绑定可以失配，正确 prepared 新实例的后续 admission/recovery 不再能加载这一状态。", "源码实际入口选择：LoadForMutation、WriteManifest、CompleteRollback 都以当前 `_effects` 类型决定路径；没有持久现代协议能力匹配拒绝。未运行该反例。"], "id": "IMPLEMENTATION-ATOMIC-VIEW-1", "obligation": "implementation", "paths": ["MultiplayerHoeingAssistant/Services/TaskCenter/MigrationSwitchTransaction.cs:377", "MultiplayerHoeingAssistant/Services/TaskCenter/MigrationSwitchTransaction.cs:549", "MultiplayerHoeingAssistant/Services/TaskCenter/MigrationSwitchTransaction.cs:1977", "MultiplayerHoeingAssistant/Services/TaskCenter/MigrationSwitchTransaction.cs:1981", "MultiplayerHoeingAssistant/Services/TaskCenter/MigrationSwitchTransaction.cs:2597", "MultiplayerHoeingAssistant/Services/TaskCenter/MigrationSwitchTransaction.cs:2635", "_workflow/r56-reference-activation-wiring-2026-09-29/native-recovery-20261001/PLAN-v3.md"], "repair_steps": ["先判定持久协议身份，再判定当前能力和操作资格；现代历史的 mutation 在能力不足时明确拒绝，不能回退普通 IO。", "身份判定覆盖 controlled baseline/latest、baseline versions、journal/declaration/binding 和实际根权威历史，包括尚无 S0 的现代 pending 事务；不能仅依赖可降级布尔字段或 journal 文件存在性。", "只读加载可保留明确历史信息，但不授予 mutation/生产资格；旧 schema 的验证、显式升级和无破坏性观察继续按原兼容合同执行。", "现代合法 mutation 始终使用本次 RootAuthority、原已拥有完整 main 输入与同事务派生发布；拒绝过程中不重新认领外来 main。", "统一核对全部公开入口及所有成功/终态/幂等分支，不能仅给 RecordChanges 加局部补丁。"], "root_cause": "现代协议的 main 发布与 RootAuthority/TxF 仍按当前实例端口类型选择。持久现代事务换成无端口或非 prepared 实例重开后，可以进入旧 WriteManifest 普通 File.Move 和旧 CompleteRollback 路径。已正确接入 prepared 路径的数据/Applied/main 共同提交不能证明这些跨构造入口也受同一协议约束。", "severity": "must", "status": "open", "tests": ["ModernHistory_ReopenWithMissingOrLegacyCapabilities_MutationEntryMatrix：Snapshotting/SnapshotReady/部分 Prepared/部分 Applied/ReferenceUpdating/Activated/Committed/RollingBack/RolledBack/Blocked 的相关合法历史，分别尝试各 mutation；不足能力时拒绝且 main/journal/pending/数据逐字节不变。", "ModernSnapshotReady_AbsentPortCannotPublishPlainMain；ModernJournal_AbsentPortRollbackCannotSeparateMainAndJournal。", "正确 prepared 能力重开仍可安全恢复，拒绝错误实例之后正确实例的 admission 和恢复不受污染。", "撤回实际协议身份/能力准入做具名行为 P/F/P，断言普通发布未发生、绑定未失配、正确新实例可恢复。原 CP2/CP29/CP30/CP39 仅证明其执行到的 prepared 路径，不能证明此跨构造分支。"]}, "source": "_workflow/r56-reference-activation-wiring-2026-09-29/native-recovery-20261001/native-compatibility-v9/requests/911b636e813d4487ba4c9bdfb791070c/checkpoints/2.json"}
0c70a01d37fdaba3d7592b2b4e743ae24320040a3053ebf984558fbaa78a66cb {"key": "0c70a01d37fdaba3d7592b2b4e743ae24320040a3053ebf984558fbaa78a66cb", "original": {"closure_evidence": [], "counterexample": "SnapshotReady stageHook starts Task.Run(() => tx.RecordChanges([])) under ExecutionContext.SuppressFlow and waits for it. _effectCallInProgress is true but CallbackOwner is null, so rejection does not happen. The outer callback waits for the worker and the worker waits for _sync. The existing twelve-entry table uses ordinary flowed Task.Run only.", "id": "IMPLEMENTATION-CALLBACK-NOFLOW-1", "obligation": "implementation", "paths": ["MultiplayerHoeingAssistant/Services/TaskCenter/MigrationSwitchTransaction.cs:2870", "Test/MultiplayerHoeingAssistant.UnitTest/ServiceTests/TaskCenter/R56ReferenceActivationWiringTests.cs:726"], "repair_steps": ["Reject new mutations on this instance whenever a callback is active, or use explicit callback admission independent of ExecutionContext propagation. Preserve serialization when no callback is active.", "Keep Dispose's atomic request and outermost deferred release; retain production gates."], "root_cause": "Lock-free callback rejection depends on AsyncLocal CallbackOwner flowing to a worker. Arbitrary supported callbacks can use SuppressFlow or UnsafeQueueUserWorkItem; the worker sees no owner and waits for the monitor held by its waiting callback.", "severity": "important", "status": "open", "tests": ["Extend the twelve-entry bounded callback-wait table with SuppressFlow and UnsafeQueueUserWorkItem, using stageHook and at least one actual prepared transform/fault seam. Assert timely refusal, no outer-state pollution and continued root exclusion.", "Delete the no-flow rejection in a single mutant and require waiting/behavior P/F/P."]}, "source": "_workflow/r56-reference-activation-wiring-2026-09-29/native-recovery-20261001/native/requests/ae4937e23a2049f787fdfc4815e1686e/report.json"}
