576ed2a63dfa779a7848f0181e306a14318158ccc5fe037a0c980241c0ed4358 {"key": "576ed2a63dfa779a7848f0181e306a14318158ccc5fe037a0c980241c0ed4358", "original": {"closure_evidence": [], "counterexample": "外层 callback 请求 Dispose，外层 finally 释放根锁后，同一对象再次调用 BeginTransaction/TryAcquireExclusive。它可以重新取得锁并开始操作；随后 EndOperation 因持久 _disposeRequested 再释放。此生命周期与方案的 DisposeRequested 后新操作拒绝不一致，也使资源是否存续依赖入口是否具备 operation-depth。", "id": "R5-IMPORTANT-4", "obligation": "implementation", "paths": ["MultiplayerHoeingAssistant/Services/TaskCenter/MigrationSwitchTransaction.cs:347", "MultiplayerHoeingAssistant/Services/TaskCenter/MigrationSwitchTransaction.cs:2286", "MultiplayerHoeingAssistant/Services/TaskCenter/MigrationSwitchTransaction.cs:2289", "MultiplayerHoeingAssistant/Services/TaskCenter/MigrationSwitchTransaction.cs:2317", "_workflow/r56-reference-activation-wiring-2026-09-29/native-recovery-20261001/V3-PROTOCOL-CANDIDATE.md"], "repair_steps": "Dispose 请求成为实例终结状态：全部新 mutation、获取锁和执行入口锁前/锁后拒绝；仅已经进入的外层安全操作完成并在 depth=0 释放。保留跨线程无等待请求、异常/早退 finally 和重复 Dispose 幂等，不将拒绝改为提前释放。", "root_cause": "DisposeRequested 能延后资源释放，但新公开操作尚未统一拒绝该终结请求。TryAcquireExclusive 仍可重新取得锁，BeginOperation 也不检查请求。", "severity": "important", "status": "open", "tests": "新增 DeferredDispose_RejectsEveryLaterOperationWithoutReacquiringAuthority；覆盖正常完成、异常、早退、回调内跨线程 Dispose，以及根锁由线程 A 取得、线程 B 操作和释放。断言第二实例只能在最外层完成后取得资格，旧对象不能重新占有。对漏终结检查和立即释放分别做行为 P/F/P。"}, "source": "_workflow/r56-reference-activation-wiring-2026-09-29/native-recovery-20261001/native/requests/c1af32163f794fffb1c1353a4f002cfa/report.json"}
5838cab28d6ea0adfb2f6a7cfe0bdcda69a682f5372d659b0d6c9a7d05b0771f {"key": "5838cab28d6ea0adfb2f6a7cfe0bdcda69a682f5372d659b0d6c9a7d05b0771f", "original": {"closure_evidence": [], "counterexample": "Host读到Cancelled且当时看似无未决事实，另一个已准备发送的写者随后补入受理job或dispatching事实，Host仍逐项终局化旧受理登记；最终重读发现Unknown已经无法撤销首次误释放。另一反例是暂停态记录含未决前置或收尾，Host只看主体InFlight便落Cancelled。旧终态标签加未决记录在重启、停止重试和驱动异常入口可继续被当作可释放终态。", "id": "CONTROL-RELEASE-ATOMICITY-1", "obligation": "plan", "paths": ["_workflow/usable-delivery-20261003/control-plan.md", "MultiplayerHoeingAssistant/Services/TaskCenter/RunStore.cs:214", "MultiplayerHoeingAssistant/Services/TaskCenter/RunStore.cs:239", "MultiplayerHoeingAssistant/Services/TaskCenter/RunStore.cs:365", "MultiplayerHoeingAssistant/Services/TaskCenter/BgiWorkflowExecutionBoundary.cs:236", "MultiplayerHoeingAssistant/Services/TaskCenter/BgiWorkflowPrerequisiteAdapter.cs", "MultiplayerHoeingAssistant/Services/TaskCenter/BgiWorkflowTerminalExecutor.cs", "MultiplayerHoeingAssistant/Services/TaskCenter/TaskCenterHost.cs:407", "MultiplayerHoeingAssistant/Services/TaskCenter/TaskCenterHost.cs:508", "MultiplayerHoeingAssistant/Services/TaskCenter/TaskCenterHost.cs:1329", "MultiplayerHoeingAssistant/Services/TaskCenter/TaskCenterHost.Admission.cs:2621", "MultiplayerHoeingAssistant/Services/TaskCenter/TaskCenterHost.Admission.cs:2687", "MultiplayerHoeingAssistant/Services/TaskCenter/TaskCenterHost.Admission.cs:2707"], "repair_steps": ["保留HasUnresolvedExternalFact的既有恢复合同，新增专用于停止/终局释放的统一资格函数，覆盖主体、全部前置及收尾事实。合法终态只接受认证的原始词和退出证明；未知词、result_unknown、缺失身份及矛盾组合均不清偿。", "明确确定零发送判据：未冻结发送且未受理的本地意图、经过认证的副作用前拒绝、队列never_started证明。不能仅按pending/Intent标签判零发送；不能因Intent=Rejected就忽略相矛盾的发送/受理字段。", "所有发送准备在RunStore同一门内重读并检查StopRequested、停止基线、未封闭状态和完整身份，再先行发布发送事实。终态封闭必须在同一门内从最新记录检查全部责任并原子落盘。已经封闭的记录禁止新增发送、受理义务或改写身份；迟到结果只可按原身份补充保守事实，不可重新取得发送资格。", "Host只消费已经耐久封闭、事实集合稳定的终局资格，并绑定该run身份与封闭版本/摘要。封闭前存在任何准备/发送窗口则不得产生释放资格。这样RunStore与受理存储间不需要假装跨文件事务，后者失败只留下可重试回写，不会先误释放再检查。", "在每个终局入口复用同一资格：Runner停止完成、Paused/LocalWaitParking停止、Cancelled重复Stop、驱动异常收敛、RecoverOnStart终态矛盾扫描、Host逐操作回写及最终重读。Unknown和未封闭记录均不得MarkOperationTerminal。", "回写过程中重新核对映射集合；存储损坏、run身份漂移、资格版本不符、部分同胞回写失败或仍存在Queued/InRound/Granted/Sending责任，返回Pending/Failed并保留原级责任。不得用已经终态的同胞掩盖其他未决项。", "按主体、前置和收尾的全组合列出状态/发送/受理/业务终态/退出事实允许表，以及停止、受理落盘、终局封闭、重启和回写间交错；未列组合保守阻断。矩阵与实际字段和测试逐项绑定，下一轮集中送审。"], "root_cause": "方案只要求Host终局回写及最终重读检查同一事实集合，没有定义释放资格如何与并发发送/受理写者线性化。当前Host从RunStore读一次终态后逐操作MarkOperationTerminal，最后仅重读受理存储；单加一次最终RunStore重读仍可能在已经错误释放后才发现事实变化。Paused停止只检查旧CurrentSubmission.InFlight；Cancelled重试直接进入终局回写；异常收敛跳过所有终态。方案也没有精确定义前置Intent/Submitted/Unknown、主体Rejected但SendAttempted、收尾pending/dispatching/submitted等组合的清偿表。", "severity": "must", "status": "open", "tests": ["TerminalLabelWithUnresolvedBodyPrerequisiteOrCompletion_RecoverToUnknownPreservesIdentity。", "PausedStopChecksAllResponsibilities；CancelledStopRetryCannotReleaseUnresolvedFacts。", "PrepareSendVersusDurableStopAndSeal_OnlyOneLegalOrder：停止先行零发送；发送先行保留未决并禁止封闭。", "HostRunReadThenLateAcceptance_DoesNotRelease；已封闭run拒绝新增发送义务。", "AdmissionSiblingWriteFailureAndFinalReadFailure_RemainPending；映射集合变化不会假Completed。", "RawTerminalUnknownOrContradictorySendFlags_BlockRelease；成功/失败/拒绝/取消与前置/收尾的允许表逐格验证。", "分别突变RunStore发送门、终局封闭资格、前置责任检查、Host封闭版本消费和最终全映射复核，要求行为P/F/P。"]}, "source": "_workflow/usable-delivery-20261003/control-native/requests/d25e7c4789e14b13be9e99edc06c60cc/report.json"}
