a1d6f3b32f7c77e1b7330a3ada3ce25db0c33a0d76227b78edcebbee83da6ff1 {"key": "a1d6f3b32f7c77e1b7330a3ada3ce25db0c33a0d76227b78edcebbee83da6ff1", "original": {"closure_evidence": [], "counterexample": "原round1 MUST-2：登记Added后他方创建同名文件，更新拒绝但回滚删除它。round2 MUST-2为降级manifest绕过；round3 MUST-2为预检时缺失、恢复期间出现X而被删除。", "id": "R1-MUST-2", "obligation": "implementation", "paths": ["_workflow/r56-reference-activation-wiring-2026-09-29/consultation/review-round1-report.raw.md", "_workflow/r56-reference-activation-wiring-2026-09-29/consultation/review-round2-report.raw.md", "_workflow/r56-reference-activation-wiring-2026-09-29/consultation/review-round3-report.raw.md", "MultiplayerHoeingAssistant/Services/TaskCenter/MigrationSwitchTransaction.cs", "MultiplayerHoeingAssistant/Services/TaskCenter/MigrationReferenceActivation.cs"], "repair_steps": "保留新增overwrite:false、实例与manifest并集归属门和删除前版本核验；补足实际删除期间的排他边界及部分Added写入证据。原round2 MUST-2和round3 MUST-2作为本条延续保留，不把未取得独立突变写成不适用。", "root_cause": "写入意图、实际创建归属和删除授权曾混为一谈；当前候选保护缺少最终认证。", "severity": "must", "status": "open", "tests": "AddedTargetNeverCreatedByTransaction_IsNotDeletedOnRollback、ForeignAddedFileWithoutActivation_IsPreservedAndRollbackBlocks、DowngradedManifestFlag_DoesNotBypassRollbackOwnership、ForeignFileCreatedDuringRollbackWindow_IsPreserved；断言实际字节保留和零误删。"}, "source": "_workflow/r56-reference-activation-wiring-2026-09-29/review-process/requests/001/report.json"}
