a6d4cb2a7592c945a27f85bf7c0add89756f7e228199e8d2faaff8e75ece8f38 {"key": "a6d4cb2a7592c945a27f85bf7c0add89756f7e228199e8d2faaff8e75ece8f38", "original": {"closure_evidence": [], "counterexample": "真实TakeSnapshot先形成S0；SnapshotReady首次stageHook新增空目录或修改基线，无journal分支仍保存旧见证并成功。没有数据操作的Rollback先Refresh，再由RolledBack prehook漂移，也可以成功清pending。未执行实验。", "id": "IMPLEMENTATION-NOJOURNAL-PUBLICATION-FRESH-1", "obligation": "implementation", "paths": ["MultiplayerHoeingAssistant/Services/TaskCenter/MigrationSwitchTransaction.cs:514", "MultiplayerHoeingAssistant/Services/TaskCenter/MigrationSwitchTransaction.cs:1874", "MultiplayerHoeingAssistant/Services/TaskCenter/MigrationSwitchTransaction.cs:2525", "MultiplayerHoeingAssistant/Services/TaskCenter/MigrationSwitchTransaction.cs:2557"], "repair_steps": ["成功发布资格统一放在发布前回调之后；已建立S0但无journal也比较原S0和当前全根。", "缺必要journal不得成为豁免；无基线中止在回调后复核严格形状、history、pending及无孤儿事实。", "明确发布后回调线性化边界，下一成功入口必须发现随后变化。"], "root_cause": "PublishPreparedMain只在有journal分支于prehook后重新取得资格。无journal分支直接发布此前ControlledLatest，允许成功发布前漂移被旧见证覆盖。", "severity": "important", "status": "open", "tests": ["SnapshotReady、无journal RolledBack及其重开发布前回调漂移矩阵。", "无基线中止回调引入孤儿操作事实应拒绝；合法空/部分复制中止仍可恢复。", "撤回无journal资格与中止事实检查，使用成功、pending、完整成员/身份和持久见证断言P/F/P。"]}, "source": "_workflow/r56-reference-activation-wiring-2026-09-29/native-recovery-20261001/native-compatibility-v9/requests/911b636e813d4487ba4c9bdfb791070c/report.json"}
