b4ba4515c4ee9b972bee106f57bd5da7f992f7db5593efa0a5a0827c89c803a1 {"key": "b4ba4515c4ee9b972bee106f57bd5da7f992f7db5593efa0a5a0827c89c803a1", "original": {"closure_evidence": ["_workflow/usable-delivery-20261003/control-plan-v2.md", "_workflow/usable-delivery-20261003/control-fact-table-v2.json", "_workflow/usable-delivery-20261003/control-risk-matrix-v2.json"], "counterexample": "Host读Cancelled后迟到受理事实被补入，旧实现仍可释放登记。v2要求未决窗口不能封印，封印后新增发送/受理写入拒绝，故不能只用最终读回发现已经发生的误释放。Paused停止、Cancelled重试和重启终态矛盾均使用同一资格。", "id": "CONTROL-RELEASE-ATOMICITY-1", "obligation": "plan", "paths": ["_workflow/usable-delivery-20261003/control-plan-v2.md", "_workflow/usable-delivery-20261003/control-fact-table-v2.json", "_workflow/usable-delivery-20261003/control-risk-matrix-v2.json", "MultiplayerHoeingAssistant/Services/TaskCenter/RunStore.cs", "MultiplayerHoeingAssistant/Services/TaskCenter/TaskCenterHost.cs", "MultiplayerHoeingAssistant/Services/TaskCenter/TaskCenterHost.Admission.cs"], "repair_steps": ["按v2 §4实现同门身份检查、停止与封印单调性、不可逆稳定资格及全部终局入口复用。", "Host在RunStore锁外回写受理存储，绑定原封印，部分失败留Pending；不能因为一个同胞已终态便忽略其他映射。", "未知或未列清偿组合继续禁止封印；补充确认MUST的两类确定零执行证据后再使用对应允许行。", "只关闭方案线性化缺陷；当前源码仍须实现与因果回归认证。"], "root_cause": "首审指出Host只读旧State后回写、最终重读不能撤销先误释放。v2已规定RunStore同门序列化准备/停止/终局封闭，耐久terminal-release封印绑定身份、修订、基线及清偿摘要；封印后禁止新增外部事实，Host锁外消费稳定封印并逐映射重试。清偿表缺少确定拒绝路径仍由CONTROL-CONFIRMATION-EXIT-1阻断，不代表该缺口已经解决。", "severity": "must", "status": "closed", "tests": ["R1：准备/Stop/封印竞态的两个合法顺序，封印后迟到发送为0。", "R2：终态标签加主体/前置/收尾未决恢复Unknown，所有终局入口都不释放。", "R3：封印落盘、等待撤销、同胞回写和最终读回失败保留可重试责任。", "移除封印门、允许旧对象移除Stop、按旧State回写、遗漏前置责任分别做因果P/F/P。"]}, "source": "_workflow/usable-delivery-20261003/control-native/requests/f82d494fb39b44368bc79fe68b58411b/report.json"}
b5e5037b99fd038bcdac210f99434295101c935202f16572a5d2e6f0ae9224d5 {"key": "b5e5037b99fd038bcdac210f99434295101c935202f16572a5d2e6f0ae9224d5", "original": {"closure_evidence": [], "counterexample": "Added 指向基线中不存在的 new/sub/a.flow.json。当前端口会创建父目录；v2 未提供目录创建的 Applied 身份、ExpectedRoot 更新或逆序空目录清理。只删除文件将留下 new/sub，最终完整 B witness 失败；忽略目录又违反本方案全根清单承诺。另一个交错是线程 T1 Begin 取得 Global mutex，T2 执行后续入口或 Dispose：mutex 所有权属于取得它的线程，不能沿用 FileStream/monitor 的任意线程释放语义。缺少专用所有者调度或明确线程契约时，可能释放异常、租约滞留或错误认定 abandoned。", "id": "PLAN-ROOT-CONSISTENCY-1", "obligation": "plan", "paths": ["_workflow/r56-reference-activation-wiring-2026-09-29/native-recovery-20261001/ROOT-CONSISTENCY-v2.md:23", "_workflow/r56-reference-activation-wiring-2026-09-29/native-recovery-20261001/ROOT-CONSISTENCY-v2.md:29", "_workflow/r56-reference-activation-wiring-2026-09-29/native-recovery-20261001/STAGE-MATRIX-v2.md:29", "_workflow/r56-reference-activation-wiring-2026-09-29/native-recovery-20261001/journal-schema-candidate.md:9", "MultiplayerHoeingAssistant/Services/TaskCenter/MigrationReferenceActivation.cs:117", "MultiplayerHoeingAssistant/Services/TaskCenter/MigrationSwitchTransaction.cs:1854", "Test/MultiplayerHoeingAssistant.UnitTest/ServiceTests/TaskCenter/R56MigrationSwitchTransactionTests.cs:680"], "repair_steps": ["固定目录策略。需要支持创建父目录时，增加目录创建/清理的持久身份、前驱、ExpectedRoot 和崩溃恢复关系；只清理确属本事务且仍为空的目录，禁止递归删除外来内容。若选择仅支持已有父目录，须明确合同依据并在任何数据副作用前拒绝，不能执行后才发现无法恢复。", "明确目录身份、空目录及新增外来子项参与 witness 比较的规则；文件和目录操作共同进入完整根派生模型。", "为根 mutex 选择可实施的线程生命周期，例如专用所有者线程负责取得和释放，公开入口通过同步调度使用该租约；定义重入、等待取消、调用线程退出、Dispose 延期及所有者异常的行为。", "不要把释放线程不匹配或超时当成 abandoned 许可。真正 abandoned 仍按持久 RootAuthorityBinding 和原 journal 恢复。", "保留 S0/fresh S_k 的同点线性化语义、捕获后 X 在下次入口发现、真实生产 Action 关闭；无需将 VSS 改称持续 quiet。"], "root_cause": "VSS 同点见证＋每边 TxF CAS 的路线可以满足原合同允许的等效一致性方向，但两个实际连接仍未定义：full-root 清单包含空目录，journal 却只有文件操作；存续 Global mutex 租约跨公开调用持有，却未规定线程所有者及跨线程 Dispose/释放协议。", "severity": "important", "status": "open", "tests": ["AddedWithNewParentDirectories_RollbackRestoresExactRootMembership。", "DirectoryCreationInterrupted_ReopenPreservesAppliedOwnership。", "OwnedDirectoryGetsForeignChild_RollbackPreservesForeignContentAndBlocks。", "ExistingEmptyDirectoryIdentity_IsPreserved。", "BeginOnThreadA_ContinueAndDisposeOnThreadB_RootLeaseReleasesExactlyOnce。", "OwnerThreadFailure_AbandonedRecoveryUsesPersistentBinding。", "DisposeDuringCallback_CrossThread_DoesNotReleaseRootAuthorityEarly。", "突变目录归属/成员检查及 mutex 所有者释放调度；验证危险行为断言和 P/F/P。"]}, "source": "_workflow/r56-reference-activation-wiring-2026-09-29/native-recovery-20261001/native/requests/ed9cc73dd6b24af0a1067bb5ec536eaa/report.json"}
