0b891a96d9679f99f823f8ff46a52d7bfb00290fa8098b08d7143b714ccf233d {"key": "0b891a96d9679f99f823f8ff46a52d7bfb00290fa8098b08d7143b714ccf233d", "original": {"closure_evidence": [], "counterexample": "原round1建议指出MigrationRehearsal使用无端口Mark*却报告真实激活。当前注释和步骤名已静态修正；尚无可核验运行报告。", "id": "R1-SUGGESTION-10", "obligation": "implementation", "paths": ["_workflow/r56-reference-activation-wiring-2026-09-29/consultation/review-round1-report.raw.md", "MultiplayerHoeingAssistant/Services/TaskCenter/MigrationRehearsal.cs", "Test/MultiplayerHoeingAssistant.UnitTest/ServiceTests/TaskCenter/R58MigrationRehearsalTests.cs"], "repair_steps": "保留阶段标记演练的准确文案；当前版本执行后核对报告没有把Mark*步骤表示为真实引用/激活生产验收。", "root_cause": "演练报告曾超出实际入口能力。", "severity": "suggestion", "status": "open", "tests": "R58演练报告步骤和最终manifest核对；不以UI文本守卫替代实际报告来源。"}, "source": "_workflow/r56-reference-activation-wiring-2026-09-29/review-process/requests/001/report.json"}
0bc2bb7da38f8d9ce8090b8f2b0a23769714a54aa2daa3c410c6f7bb87fbf527 {"key": "0bc2bb7da38f8d9ce8090b8f2b0a23769714a54aa2daa3c410c6f7bb87fbf527", "original": {"closure_evidence": [], "counterexample": ["真实 prepared 事务达到 SnapshotReady 后 Dispose，以 effectService:null 重开并取得 artifact 锁。RecordChanges 可以 LoadValidated 现代 manifest，并经2597–2611行普通 IO 发布，而没有现代 RootAuthority 和完整 main 输入 CAS。", "现代有 journal 历史由无 prepared 能力实例调用 Rollback/Recover，main 的 RollingBack 发布走普通 IO，旧 CompleteRollback 又单独 SetStage journal；main/journal 绑定可以失配，正确 prepared 新实例的后续 admission/recovery 不再能加载这一状态。", "源码实际入口选择：LoadForMutation、WriteManifest、CompleteRollback 都以当前 `_effects` 类型决定路径；没有持久现代协议能力匹配拒绝。未运行该反例。"], "id": "IMPLEMENTATION-ATOMIC-VIEW-1", "obligation": "implementation", "paths": ["MultiplayerHoeingAssistant/Services/TaskCenter/MigrationSwitchTransaction.cs:377", "MultiplayerHoeingAssistant/Services/TaskCenter/MigrationSwitchTransaction.cs:549", "MultiplayerHoeingAssistant/Services/TaskCenter/MigrationSwitchTransaction.cs:1977", "MultiplayerHoeingAssistant/Services/TaskCenter/MigrationSwitchTransaction.cs:1981", "MultiplayerHoeingAssistant/Services/TaskCenter/MigrationSwitchTransaction.cs:2597", "MultiplayerHoeingAssistant/Services/TaskCenter/MigrationSwitchTransaction.cs:2635", "_workflow/r56-reference-activation-wiring-2026-09-29/native-recovery-20261001/PLAN-v3.md"], "repair_steps": ["先判定持久协议身份，再判定当前能力和操作资格；现代历史的 mutation 在能力不足时明确拒绝，不能回退普通 IO。", "身份判定覆盖 controlled baseline/latest、baseline versions、journal/declaration/binding 和实际根权威历史，包括尚无 S0 的现代 pending 事务；不能仅依赖可降级布尔字段或 journal 文件存在性。", "只读加载可保留明确历史信息，但不授予 mutation/生产资格；旧 schema 的验证、显式升级和无破坏性观察继续按原兼容合同执行。", "现代合法 mutation 始终使用本次 RootAuthority、原已拥有完整 main 输入与同事务派生发布；拒绝过程中不重新认领外来 main。", "统一核对全部公开入口及所有成功/终态/幂等分支，不能仅给 RecordChanges 加局部补丁。"], "root_cause": "现代协议的 main 发布与 RootAuthority/TxF 仍按当前实例端口类型选择。持久现代事务换成无端口或非 prepared 实例重开后，可以进入旧 WriteManifest 普通 File.Move 和旧 CompleteRollback 路径。已正确接入 prepared 路径的数据/Applied/main 共同提交不能证明这些跨构造入口也受同一协议约束。", "sever