391707af8d335b974e6b6c1f7b53e9306db2533f694180beeddd7df5bc103b43 {"key": "391707af8d335b974e6b6c1f7b53e9306db2533f694180beeddd7df5bc103b43", "original": {"closure_evidence": [], "counterexample": "OnApply在真实引用端口读取前替换Modified目标为仍含RenameFrom的X，端口直接基于X改写；或OnReferenceRead替换成含RenameTo的X，语义读回成功，TryHashConfigFile把Hash(X)登记为确认写集。激活后状态读回也可将X/active登记为AfterHash。", "id": "IMPLEMENTATION-FORWARD-VERSION-1", "obligation": "implementation", "paths": ["MultiplayerHoeingAssistant/Services/TaskCenter/MigrationReferenceActivation.cs", "MultiplayerHoeingAssistant/Services/TaskCenter/MigrationSwitchTransaction.cs", "Test/MultiplayerHoeingAssistant.UnitTest/ServiceTests/TaskCenter/R56ReferenceActivationWiringTests.cs"], "repair_steps": "为Modified目标传入快照/当前已确认输入哈希并在真实读取byte[]上核验；准备确定性输出字节和哈希。引用与激活读回从同一byte[]解析语义并比较预期输出，不把任何恰好具有目标状态的当前文件直接登记为证据。Added按声明原始字节确认。替换期间的排他边界必须明确。", "root_cause": "首次引用更新没有事务输入版本绑定，正向读回只有语义成立加当前哈希，没有独立预期输出版本。", "severity": "must", "status": "open", "tests": "ReferencePortRejectsForeignInputBeforeRead、ReferenceReadbackNeverRegistersForeignOutput、ActivationReadbackNeverRegistersForeignActiveOutput；一次性回调、X字节保留、无X写集/AfterHash、Blocked及零授权；分别移除输入和输出比较应使具名用例失败。"}, "source": "_workflow/r56-reference-activation-wiring-2026-09-29/review-process/requests/001/report.json"}
