8f993661edbe7db6bb601c563a622ddd77c5309a02740c16042a29870dd648fa {"key": "8f993661edbe7db6bb601c563a622ddd77c5309a02740c16042a29870dd648fa", "original": {"closure_evidence": [], "counterexample": "After real Prepared reference/activation, the Commit stageHook loads main, changes CreatedAtUtc, reseals schema2 integrity and writes it while leaving the journal projection unchanged. BuildMainCompanion accepts the new raw hash but projects the old requested object, overwriting foreign metadata. Moving original main aside and creating identical bytes with a different FileId also passes hash-only artifact CAS. A failure followed by MarkBlocked->LoadManifest->WriteManifest can adopt that foreign valid main again. CP14 covers only the legacy no-journal branch.", "id": "IMPLEMENTATION-MODERN-MAIN-CAS-1", "obligation": "implementation", "paths": ["MultiplayerHoeingAssistant/Services/TaskCenter/MigrationSwitchTransaction.cs:773", "MultiplayerHoeingAssistant/Services/TaskCenter/MigrationSwitchTransaction.cs:2398", "MultiplayerHoeingAssistant/Services/TaskCenter/MigrationVersionStore.cs:26", "MultiplayerHoeingAssistant/Services/TaskCenter/WindowsTxfMigrationVersionStore.cs:264", "MultiplayerHoeingAssistant/Services/TaskCenter/MigrationSwitchTransaction.cs:2356"], "repair_steps": ["Capture verified original main bytes and full stable-handle version before publication callbacks. Carry immutable expected bytes/length/identity into modern companionOverride and compare on the actual TxF artifact writer handle; never reselect the expected input after callbacks.", "Apply the same owned-input rule to Create/Prepare/Applied/stage and failed-publication handling. MarkBlocked/retries must consume a provable original input or committed output; if ownership is unknown, return structured refusal while preserving foreign main, journal and pending facts."], "root_cause": "PublishPreparedMain captures expectedMainSha before stageHook, but its journal branch does not pass that expectation to BuildMainCompanion. The latter rereads raw main after the hook and uses that hash as CAS input. ValidateMainAgainstAuthority checks derived fields, so a valid foreign CreatedAtUtc change is accepted as overwrite input. MigrationArtifactWrite has only ExpectedSha256, not file identity, and MarkBlocked can reread foreign main and adopt it again.", "severity": "must", "status": "open", "tests": ["ModernJournalPublication_ForeignResealedMainBeforeHookReturn_IsPreserved for Commit, RolledBack and ReferenceUpdating. Add same-bytes/different-FileId replacement, retry and failure-MarkBlocked cases. Assert foreign bytes and identity stay unchanged, no stage success and no partial pending/journal publication.", "Mutate the expectation back to post-callback reread and remove identity comparison separately; require causal byte/identity/stage P/F/P, not reason-string failure."]}, "source": "_workflow/r56-reference-activation-wiring-2026-09-29/native-recovery-20261001/native/requests/ae4937e23a2049f787fdfc4815e1686e/report.json"}
906ce604bcbe7dfc39af9e2da502cd5bc8a9c13448bb9c5893cd7fb8177f221d {"key": "906ce604bcbe7dfc39af9e2da502cd5bc8a9c13448bb9c5893cd7fb8177f221d", "original": {"closure_evidence": [], "counterexample": "Activate 的 TxF 已提交后在 activate:after_commit 中断，主 ActivationRecord 尚为空。重开 CompleteRollback 不调用 UndoActivation，RestoreFromSnapshot 可直接以 journal 的 Activate 输出为前驱执行 A→B，违反原严格 A→R→B 合同。另一可达路径是实际 prepared 事务的 journal 丢失或损坏后，ActivateCandidate、RestoreFromSnapshot 或 DeleteRecordedAdditions 选择旧普通 IO 分支，而不是在副作用前拒绝。", "id": "IMPLEMENTATION-ATOMIC-VIEW-1", "obligation": "implementation", "paths": ["MultiplayerHoeingAssistant/Services/TaskCenter/MigrationSwitchTransaction.cs:828", "MultiplayerHoeingAssistant/Services/TaskCenter/MigrationSwitchTransaction.cs:918", "MultiplayerHoeingAssistant/Services/TaskCenter/MigrationSwitchTransaction.cs:1422", "MultiplayerHoeingAssistant/Services/TaskCenter/MigrationSwitchTransaction.cs:1890", "MultiplayerHoeingAssistant/Services/TaskCenter/MigrationSwitchTransaction.cs:1926", "MultiplayerHoeingAssistant/Services/TaskCenter/MigrationSwitchTransaction.cs:1971", "MultiplayerHoeingAssistant/Services/TaskCenter/MigrationOperationJournal.cs:294", "_workflow/r56-reference-activation-wiring-2026-09-29/native-recovery-20261001/journal-schema-candidate.md", "_workflow/r56-reference-activation-wiring-2026-09-29/native-recovery-20261001/STAGE-MATRIX-v2.md"], "repair_steps": "统一 schema2 的权威操作记录与主 manifest 派生视图。恢复先验证冻结声明、严格序列、全部 receipt/blob、最近 Applied 和阶段关系，再派生引用及激活事实；激活已 Applied 时必须按严格 Undo→Restore/Delete 续做。实现方案约定的数据/receipt/操作状态同 Tx 提交，以及 fresh witness 后 stage/witness 的 manifest CAS 发布；不能用两份文件各自有效代替跨文件关系有效。对实际 prepared 路径，缺 journal、receipt、输出工件或阶段关系时拒绝普通 IO 回退。登记冻结从首次 Prepared 生效。精确 B 观察独立持久化，不能伪造 Restore Applied、把 B 同步成 R，或让最终全根派生仍要求历史 A/R。", "root_cause": "实际数据与 Applied receipt/journal 已配对提交，但主 manifest 的激活记录、派生写集和成功阶段仍由后续普通 File.Move 发布。恢复逻辑仍部分依赖这个滞后视图；prepared 实例在 journal 缺失时还存在普通 IO 回退。当前 journal 校验也没有实现原完整阶段表的全部关系。", "severity": "must", "status": "open", "tests": "增强 AtomicActivationInterruptedAfterCommit_NewInstanceRestoresExactBaseline，除最终字节外断言真实 Activate→Undo→Restore 顺序、前驱完整版本与 receipt，禁止直接 A→B。新增 PreparedTransaction_MissingOrDamagedJournal_NeverFallsBackToOrdinaryIO、FirstPrepared_FreezesWholeDeclaration、ExactBaselineObservation_BNotEqualR_ReopensWithoutInventedApplied。覆盖 data/receipt 提交后至主视图发布、journal stage 发布至 manifest stage 发布的真实进程退出窗口。对直接恢复 A、普通 IO 回退、延迟登记冻结、阶段关系放宽及伪造 B/R 观察分别执行行为 P/F/P。"}, "source": "_workflow/r56-reference-activation-wiring-2026-09-29/native-recovery-20261001/native/requests/c1af32163f794fffb1c1353a4f002cfa/report.json"}
91c83c22ff597aaf028ff6e171dfe649f601989c380fd9164afce04d875834d8 {"key": "91c83c22ff597aaf028ff6e171dfe649f601989c380fd9164afce04d875834d8", "original": {"closure_evidence": "", "counterexample": "shared-instance fixture does not prove dual-copy merge", "id": "G2(e)", "obligation": "implementation", "paths": ["Test/MultiplayerHoeingAssistant.UnitTest/ServiceTests/TaskCenter/"], "repair_steps": "add independent load→persist→merge→Rejected fixture", "root_cause": "real double-copy + Rejected E2E fixture missing", "severity": "important", "status": "open", "tests": ["TaskCenterSuccessorPathGateTests"]}, "source": "_workflow/local-wait-admission-gates-20261004/review-process/registration.json"}
9215e504a9d889466d15e385cb59d62d41b323b3c9e0494b83bc816d27271f3a {"key": "9215e504a9d889466d15e385cb59d62d41b323b3c9e0494b83bc816d27271f3a", "original": {"closure_evidence": [], "counterexample": "同一 current_regression/exit0 收据含声明的 TRX 和 controlled-writer-evidence.json。ee.validate_manifest/validate 认证全部结果后，现有 implementation_proofs 仍解析 JSON，阻止 native receipt 发布。更新 bundle 又要求重取所有当前执行，不能修循环后直接改标旧收据。", "id": "FACILITY-NATIVE-MIXED-RESULTS-1", "obligation": "implementation", "paths": ["tools/mistletoe/native_review.py:252", "tools/mistletoe/execution_evidence.py:151", "tools/mistletoe/execution_evidence.py:186", "tools/mistletoe/test_native_review.py:719", "_workflow/r56-reference-activation-wiring-2026-09-29/native-recovery-20261001/plan-v12.json:70", "_workflow/r56-reference-activation-wiring-2026-09-29/native-recovery-20261001/typed-trx-proof-v12/candidate-method-v12.json"], "repair_steps": ["先合批修订并通过上述方案义务，再按有限许可新增真实认证 mixed fixture，在原合法 e127 bundle 下取得旧循环的具名真实红例。", "保持 ee.validate_manifest、ee.validate 和所有 JSON/inputs/logs/products 认证不变；仅对完整 result 路径精确属于 manifest.tests 声明集合的结果提取 Passed testId。", "只刷新既有 native_review.py bundle 成员的规范化 hash，15-key 集合不变；测试文件由执行 inputs 认证，不新增 bundle key。", "保留 named-proof、全部 mutation_check、target_test_id、指定失败断言和恢复门；按冻结候选 recipe 的显式 origin/subject/argv 完成 parser 因果 P/F/P。", "JSON 篡改、JSON-only、未声明 TRX、同 basename 不同完整路径、缺 testId/mutation、错误 target/断言均须拒绝。工具 parser 证明只关闭该工具根因，不能替代产品证明。", "新 bundle 下重取全部规定当前产品回归和 45 目标 P/F/P，再进行一个综合 implementation 审查；旧 d6 报告、失败 capture 和无 native receipt 状态原样保留。"], "root_cause": "冻结 native_review.implementation_proofs 仍对每个认证 results 无条件调用 parse_trx，合法 writer JSON 会导致 XML ParseError。V12 的精确 manifest.tests 路径分派方案可行，但尚未取得完整可执行方案许可、实施或当前认证。", "severity": "important", "status": "open", "tests": ["真实认证 mixed TRX+JSON 在旧循环触发解析红例，修复后通过，撤回路径分派后按 typed_trx_mixed_receipt_parsed_as_xml 指定断言失败，恢复后通过。", "所有拒绝分支仍由原认证、具名 proof 和 mutation 检查实际拒绝。", "baseline/restored 隔离副本与修复后 origin 字节相等，negative_test 仅改变副本；三段 conditions、映射、argv 和目标身份一致。", "规定产品回归与全部 45 目标使用新 bundle 的当前认证原件，原级实现义务由后审逐项核验。"]}, "source": "_workflow/r56-reference-activation-wiring-2026-09-29/native-recovery-20261001/native-compatibility-v9/requests/93c579f1dfd34055883bed3e18ac003c/report.json"}
96534b1955e92da7fa9a010e8406c9b9dfeadf013debcac01ac1020fde179533 {"key": "96534b1955e92da7fa9a010e8406c9b9dfeadf013debcac01ac1020fde179533", "original": {"closure_evidence": [], "counterexample": "Removing or narrowing ReadActivationStatusGuarded catch, releasing authority immediately at callback return, or removing the latest-Restore exact-B continuation does not alter the roots discriminated by those three selected PFP paths. F16/F25/F28, C7/C9 and R6-MUST-1 remain tagged covered by unrelated shared IDs.", "id": "IMPLEMENTATION-PROOF-RELEVANCE-1", "obligation": "implementation", "paths": ["_workflow/r56-reference-activation-wiring-2026-09-29/risk-matrix.json", "MultiplayerHoeingAssistant/Services/TaskCenter/MigrationSwitchTransaction.cs:1821", "MultiplayerHoeingAssistant/Services/TaskCenter/MigrationSwitchTransaction.cs:2831", "MultiplayerHoeingAssistant/Services/TaskCenter/MigrationSwitchTransaction.cs:2926"], "repair_steps": ["Preserve original scenarios/severities and correct mapping/status. Add current causal PFP for the already-green exception, mid-Dispose and restored-B fault scenarios.", "Retain precise legacy diagnostic F25/F28 stations. Where Prepared replaces post-Undo status callbacks, demonstrate the replacement's actual transform/Applied/recovery fault cause, not Record reentry.", "Keep applicable-but-mutant-unproven REF-C4 as its original residual; do not turn this into a zero-bug or unlimited-scope requirement."], "root_cause": "Valid current PFP records do not prove every original fault root. CP6 removes callback rejection only, CP7 removes disposed-entry rejection only, and CP10 removes BaselineObservation only when latest is not Restore. These cannot establish original exception containment, mid-operation release deferral or resume after actual Restore has produced B.", "severity": "important", "status": "open", "tests": ["Exception mutants must alter the real catch and assert actual station reached, structured Blocked and no repeat/leak. Early-release mutants must alter EndOperation/Dispose deferral and assert another instance cannot acquire before the outer operation ends.", "R6 proof must use B!=R, real Restore after_commit/fileRestoredHook interruption, a fresh instance, latest Restore receipt and terminal reopen; removing legitimate B continuation must fail."]}, "source": "_workflow/r56-reference-activation-wiring-2026-09-29/native-recovery-20261001/native/requests/ae4937e23a2049f787fdfc4815e1686e/report.json"}
9837ec443d7e2b52f3767810a06b4bf8b1d5041cf9afa55c996f617d11c3e3dc {"key": "9837ec443d7e2b52f3767810a06b4bf8b1d5041cf9afa55c996f617d11c3e3dc", "original": {"closure_evidence": "", "counterexample": "prepare rejection reason lost in fixed text", "id": "G10-residual", "obligation": "implementation", "paths": ["MultiplayerHoeingAssistant/Models/TaskCenter/", "MultiplayerHoeingAssistant/Services/TaskCenter/TaskCenterHost.Admission.cs"], "repair_steps": "add reason detail fields and passthrough", "root_cause": "structured ledger fields do not carry original reason", "severity": "important", "status": "open", "tests": []}, "source": "_workflow/local-wait-admission-gates-20261004/review-process/registration.json"}
9a1a83113e020f2e84021711ae9d58b1796e7b3a10f5644c1c91af9d151774d3 {"key": "9a1a83113e020f2e84021711ae9d58b1796e7b3a10f5644c1c91af9d151774d3", "original": {"closure_evidence": [], "counterexample": "按 V12 取得新有效方案许可、仅修改三个工具文件并完成全部新执行，然后运行 workflow.audit。opening_check 发现 8→22 的 source 差异并调用 validate_scope_extension；当前 extension 仍指向 7eb064，因 scope extension not bound to approved plan 被拒绝。没有新增产品源码也不会避免这一检查。", "id": "PLAN-NATIVE-BUNDLE-COMPATIBILITY-1", "obligation": "plan", "paths": ["tools/mistletoe/workflow.py:330", "tools/mistletoe/native_review.py:853", "_workflow/r56-reference-activation-wiring-2026-09-29/opening.json", "_workflow/r56-reference-activation-wiring-2026-09-29/manifest.json", "_workflow/r56-reference-activation-wiring-2026-09-29/native-recovery-20261001/plan-v12.json:95"], "repair_steps": ["在下一完整方案中增加原 scope 扩展的身份承接步骤，保持原 opening、registration、22 sources、14 个 added paths 和所有产品字节不变。", "取得新方案的真实有效 receipt 和 permit 后，将当前 native_scope_extension 完整保留到 historical_native_scope_extensions；仅将 active extension 的 plan_request、plan_receipt_sha256 绑定到这次实际批准的请求及 receipt 字节 SHA。", "明确这只是原已批准 14 个新增源码范围的当前身份承接，不增加 source、不移除 source、不授予新的产品修改许可。本次工具实施许可继续限于 native_review.py 的结果分派、必要测试和既有 bundle hash。", "在原 opening_check、validate_scope_extension、audit/verify 的实际消费链上核对差集、路径存在性和当前绑定；不得修改验证器、原 opening 或旧许可来消除拒绝。", "保留 V12 已正确规定的 15-key bundle、真实红例、新 bundle 重取全部规定执行、九字段完整比较和稳定合同规则。"], "root_cause": "V12 已纠正固定 15 个 bundle 成员、测试输入认证、原 22 sources 和隔离副本执行等问题，但遗漏原已批准 source extension 的当前许可身份承接。opening.sources 为 8 项，manifest.sources 为 22 项，native_scope_extension 的 14 个 paths 正好覆盖差集，却仍绑定旧 plan_request=7eb064d91dab44c99cc5da2e41f97844。validate_scope_extension 强制它绑定当前 latest plan request 和该请求的实际 receipt SHA；新的方案许可产生后，现有 extension 会失效。", "severity": "important", "status": "open", "tests": ["只重绑许可身份，14 个 paths 与 set(manifest.sources)-set(opening.sources) 精确相等，产品 22 项哈希不变，原 opening_check 接受当前有效许可。", "保留旧 plan_request 或错误 receipt SHA，原 validate_scope_extension 必须拒绝。", "增删任一原 source 或 extension path、使用未批准路径，原检查仍拒绝。", "工具修复后的 bundle key-set 保持原 15 项；旧 e127 receipt 不能冒充新 bundle 当前执行。"]}, "source": "_workflow/r56-reference-activation-wiring-2026-09-29/native-recovery-20261001/native-compatibility-v9/requests/93c579f1dfd34055883bed3e18ac003c/report.json"}
9fc10f50bd9f4eca55a906f38859f1b52fabf7e5b8672867b94a3103bc7cffef {"key": "9fc10f50bd9f4eca55a906f38859f1b52fabf7e5b8672867b94a3103bc7cffef", "original": {"closure_evidence": [], "counterexample": "第一次引用操作发布 Prepared 后、TxF commit 前进程退出。数据回退至 B 或不存在，Applied 不存在。新实例即使 fresh witness 证明全根等于基线，也不能伪造 Applied，不能带 Prepared 发布 RolledBack，且没有合法取消转换。若前 k 项已 Applied、第 k+1 项 Prepared 未 commit，则还无法在它后面追加 Undo/Restore/Delete，因为破坏“Applied 前缀＋唯一末项 Prepared”。这会把无外来 X 的普通崩溃变成永久阻断。", "id": "PLAN-VERSION-CHAIN-1", "obligation": "plan", "paths": ["_workflow/r56-reference-activation-wiring-2026-09-29/native-recovery-20261001/STAGE-MATRIX-v2.md:9", "_workflow/r56-reference-activation-wiring-2026-09-29/native-recovery-20261001/STAGE-MATRIX-v2.md:22", "_workflow/r56-reference-activation-wiring-2026-09-29/native-recovery-20261001/journal-schema-candidate.md:9", "_workflow/r56-reference-activation-wiring-2026-09-29/native-recovery-20261001/journal-schema-candidate.md:23"], "repair_steps": ["定义 Prepared→NotApplied/Aborted，或等价的活动链取消与不可变历史保存协议；明确 schema、摘要、序列及前驱关系，不能删除原意图或伪造 Applied。", "只有在取得根权威、确认相关 KTM 已终结、合法收据不存在、当前输入完整匹配时才能取消。commit 未知、有矛盾收据或当前 X 时保持阻断。", "取消记录与活动链/manifest 的变化同交易发布；允许之后追加合法回滚边，同时保留全部已 Applied 事实及真实写入数。", "补齐 SnapshotReady、ReferenceUpdating、RollingBack、Blocked、RolledBack 对已取消末项的允许表，以及取消发布中断后的重开规则。"], "root_cause": "v2 已补输出身份、墓碑、部分前缀及阶段表，但缺少未应用 Prepared 的合法终结协议。State 只有 Prepared/Applied；Applied 必须连续前缀、Prepared 只能是末项；RolledBack 禁止未完成 Prepared，Blocked 又禁止正向操作。方案没有取消、NotApplied 或将末项移交不可变历史的转换。", "severity": "must", "status": "open", "tests": ["PreparedOnly_NoDataCommit_ReopenSafeAbort。", "AppliedPrefix_WithUncommittedPreparedTail_ReopenRollbackConverges。", "PreparedUndoRestoreDelete_InterruptedBeforeCommit_CanBeCancelledOrRetriedSafely。", "CommitUnknown_WithAppliedReceipt_IsNeverCancelledAsNotApplied。", "PreparedCancellationPublicationInterrupted_ReopenKeepsCompleteHistory。", "突变取消条件、收据检查及取消记录原子发布；具名行为断言和 P/F/P 必须有效。"]}, "source": "_workflow/r56-reference-activation-wiring-2026-09