2144:    /// <summary>游标 → 当前计划中的出现（恢复/推进共用；身份失效按最后完成身份重算，不回链首重跑）。</summary>
2145:    private WorkflowNodeOccurrence? Relocate(WorkflowRunRecord run, WorkflowPlan plan)
2146:    {
2147:        if (run.TailReached) return null;
2148:        if (run.Cursor is null) return plan.FirstOccurrence();
2149:        if (plan.TryLocate(run.Cursor.NodeId, run.Cursor.Occurrence, run.Cursor.LoopIteration, out var occ))
2150:            return occ with { PathLane = run.Cursor.PathLane };
2151:        if ((run.MigrationEntrySeedKey is not null || run.ExplicitEntryNodeId is not null) && run.NodeOutcomes.Count == 0)
2152:            throw new InvalidOperationException("初始入口在当前修订中已失效，未执行、未回落链首。");
2153:        var relocated = RecomputeSuccessor(run, plan);
2154:        ApplyRelocation(run, relocated);
2155:        _runs.Update(run);
